ning on his staff,\ntending them as he leans—\nor like the herdsman sleeping outdoors,\nspending night beside his peaceful flock,\nguarding against wild beasts that might scatter them—\nsuch were we three at that hour:\nI like the goat, they like shepherds,\nhemmed in on both sides by stone.\nLittle of the outer world could be seen,\nbut through that little I beheld stars\nmore luminous and large than usual.\nContemplating and watching these,\nsleep seized me—sleep that often knows\nthe future before deeds are done.\nAt the hour when Venus first beams\nfrom the East upon the mountain,\nshe who seems always burning with love's fire,\nI dreamed I saw a young and beautiful lady\nwalking in a meadow, gathering flowers,\nand as she sang, she said:","startTime":165.44,"endTime":247.52,"words":[{"word":"The","start":165.521,"end":165.681},{"word":"path","start":165.681,"end":166.081},{"word":"climbed","start":166.081,"end":166.561},{"word":"straight","start":166.561,"end":166.881},{"word":"through","start":166.881,"end":167.321},{"word":"rock","start":167.321,"end":167.761},{"word":"so","start":167.761,"end":167.921},{"word":"that","start":167.921,"end":168.161},{"word":"I","start":168.161,"end":168.374},{"word":"blocked","start":168.374,"end":168.561},{"word":"the","start":168.561,"end":168.801},{"word":"rays","start":168.801,"end":169.001},{"word":"of","start":169.001,"end":169.121},{"word":"the","start":169.121,"end":169.281},{"word":"now-lowering","start":169.281,"end":170.081},{"word":"sun","start":170.081,"end":170.401},{"word":"before","start":170.401,"end":170.801},{"word":"me.","start":170.801,"end":171.601},{"word":"We","start":171.601,"end":171.761},{"word":"had","start":171.761,"end":171.881},{"word":"tried","start":171.881,"end":172.161},{"word":"only","start":172.161,"end":172.481},{"word":"a","start":172.481,"end":172.641},{"word":"few","start":172.641,"end":172.961},{"word":"steps","start":172.961,"end":173.281},{"word":"when","start":173.281,"end":173.441}